{"id":"n1-077","title":"Noun のいかんにかかわらず","romaji":"Noun no ikan ni kakawarazu","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Regardless of, irrespective of.","longExplanation":"The phrase 'Noun のいかんにかかわらず' is used to express that something is the case irrespective of a certain condition. It can be translated as 'regardless of' or 'irrespective of' in English. This phrase is used with nouns.","formation":"Noun + のいかんにかかわらず","examples":[{"jp":"結果のいかんにかかわらず、彼は決定を後悔しなかった。","romaji":"Kekka no ikan ni kakawarazu, kare wa kettei wo koukai shinakatta.","en":"Regardless of the outcome, he didn't regret his decision.","words":[{"surface":"結果","vocabId":"1254690","reading":"けっか"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いかん","vocabId":"1159090","reading":"いかん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"かかわら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"かかわる"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"決定","vocabId":"1254380","reading":"けってい"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"後悔","vocabId":"1269510","reading":"こうかい"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"なかっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,4,5]},{"jp":"年齢のいかんにかかわらず、どんな人でも学ぶことは可能です。","romaji":"Nenrei no ikan ni kakawarazu, donna hito demo manabu koto wa kanou desu.","en":"Regardless of age, anyone can learn.","words":[{"surface":"年齢","vocabId":"1600240","reading":"ねんれい"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いかん","vocabId":"1159090","reading":"いかん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"かかわら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"かかわる"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"どんな","vocabId":null},{"surface":"人","vocabId":"1580640","reading":"ひと"},{"surface":"でも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"学ぶ","vocabId":"1206530","reading":"まなぶ"},{"surface":"こ